h touch OLED screens and a Dynamic Island instead of the notch. Apple hasn't confirmed anything yet. Prices could land up to &#036;500 above today's &#036;2,499 start. Wed Oct 28: Microsoft and Alphabet earnings after the close, a few hours after the Fed decision – Microsoft guided Azure to about 45% growth, Google Cloud grew 82% last quarter. If either cools off, the whole AI trade feels it. Wed Oct 28: iQOO Neo 12 launches in China – 9,000mAh battery, 100W charging, Snapdragon 8 Elite Gen 5 and an actual cooling fan inside the phone. Thu Oct 29: Phantom Blade Zero hits PS5 and PC – S-Game's kung fu action RPG has lived on gorgeous trailers for years. Now we find out if it plays as well as it looks. The Wolf Among Us Remastered drops the same day on every platform. Thu Oct 29: Amazon and Intel report after the close – AWS did &#036;42.2B last quarter, up 37%. For Intel, options are pricing a move of roughly 9%, so the turnaround story gets tested either way. Thu Oct 29 (expected): ULA Vulcan launches a batch of Amazon Leo satellites from Cape Canaveral, no earlier than this date – Amazon's Starlink rival needs every launch it can get. Fri Oct 30: iPhone Duo rolls out to 28 more countries and regions – the second wave after its Oct 23 debut, so more of you can finally try it in person. See it coming.","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/oVd3kkBNXe8KR2Kcyccyxn61MZXiiT3bFCKNsN1ngJF6fo1RDLn3XOcGF-zeXOgBXzMW-Lo1fxpfR-AzdTUGesIFshvFK5DbdYY84374utONiYfU51BrR6lCGMqNUukmKSs1n48FTxV8_OrLWDIN8pqxXrZQjRYZdLtK1DFYCAJjigEcXQiIClnyKmRCPlVRgz3BpMILtVfL-nf5xLaotNVN6x6lzZ46Wmuw-44vkZaNL3wEw3ZN6kbWygQhyaJYuIqLSVYy-cdtM56KaE5b9Qnak3juBQgmfUlf425e9LMKj3VhkKwGmIEgh6OXdY0YaS007D-JxYE8TNWEZJlPAQ.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"278","date":"2026-10-26T00:54:29+00:00","text":"Fitbit Air vs. Whoop: Which screenless fitness tracker is better for you? Read on Engadget","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/bBMYMb-iU4U_DtEpxq0WWHtywIUbDR-YK6XRVxFyO_WM99eww7BzV1bY_FIaJP36cWxb1Ew4Q0lL6